  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "neutral",
      "title": "How to read this map",
      "items": [
        "Arrows show selected package dependencies, not network traffic. server/ is a separate Go module that imports the library.",
        "The map groups composition code by purpose. The current tier test classifies server-prefixed packages in the server tier."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "policy",
      "title": "Enforced rules and exceptions",
      "items": [
        "Tests reject unapproved upward imports and package-unit cycles. The explicit upward exception is mdmprotocol/enroll/ade importing appleplatformservices/gdmf.",
        "Test scaffolding is excluded from the tier rule. pki/pushcert remains independent of the push client and imports only the standard library."
      ]
    },
